 *** README 

	Supplemental material for the article
	
	Kosiol,C., Holmes,I., Goldman,N., 2007.
	An empirical codon model for protein sequence evolution
         




*** Components
	
	 
MoreKappaModels.pdf  		Definition of further kappa models	


ECMrest.dat	  		Instantaneous rate matrix of the 
		  		restricted empirical codon model 


ECMunrest.dat			Instantaneous rate matrix of the 
		  		unrestricted empirical codon model


ParameterValuesM0.txt   	Parameter values for the M0 model


Table_lnL.txt           	List of log-likelihood values for the 
				different codon models analyzed


ProteinFamiliesSDT.txt  	List of the protein families analyzed to 
				compare SDT and the empirical codon model 
